      "english": "Mind the slippery floor"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "保罗在中国学汉语已经有几个月了。",
      "traditional": "保羅在中國學漢語已經有幾個月了。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó zài zhōng guó xué hàn yǔ yǐ jīng yǒu jǐ ge yuè le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "有一天，他逛商场的时候突然想去卫生间。",
      "traditional": "有一天，他逛商場的時候突然想去衛生間。",
      "pinyin": "yǒu yì tiān tā guàng shāng chǎng de shí hou tū rán xiǎng qù wèi shēng jiān",
      "english": "Paul had been studying Chinese in China for several months."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "到卫生间门口，他看到清洁工刚刚打扫完，地板还是湿的，",
      "traditional": "到衛生間門口，他看到清潔工剛剛打掃完，地板還是濕的，",
      "pinyin": "dào wèi shēng jiān mén kǒu tā kàn dào qīng jié gōng gāng gang dǎ sǎo wán dì bǎn hái shì shī de",
      "english": "One day, when he was wandering in a shopping mall, he suddenly needed to use the bathroom."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "旁边有一个标示牌，上面写着：小心地滑。",
      "traditional": "旁邊有一個標示牌，上面寫著：小心地滑。",
      "pinyin": "páng biān yǒu yí ge biāo shì pái shàng miàn xiě zhe xiǎo xīn de huá",
      "english": "When he arrived at the bathroom, he noticed that the cleaner had just finished cleaning, leaving the floor wet."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "保罗心想，这家商场真不错，提醒大家滑的时候要小心。",
      "traditional": "保羅心想，這家商場真不錯，提醒大家滑的時候要小心。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó xīn xiǎng zhè jiā shāng chǎng zhēn bú cuò tí xǐng dà jiā huá de shí hou yào xiǎo xīn",
      "english": "By the side stood a sign saying “slide carefully”."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "然后，他非常小心地从地板上慢慢地滑进了卫生间，就像玩滑板那样。",
      "traditional": "然後，他非常小心地從地板上慢慢地滑進了衛生間，就像玩滑板那樣。",
      "pinyin": "rán hòu tā fēi cháng xiǎo xīn de cóng dì bǎn shang màn man de huá jìn le wèi shēng jiān jiù xiàng wán huá bǎn nà yàng",
      "english": "What a thoughtful shopping mall that reminds people to be careful when sliding, Paul thought to himself."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "可是保罗却发现有几个人一直在奇怪地看着他。",
      "traditional": "可是保羅卻發現有幾個人一直在奇怪地看著他。",
      "pinyin": "kě shì bǎo luó què fā xiàn yǒu jǐ ge rén yì zhí zài qí guài de kàn zhe tā",
      "english": "He then slid into the bathroom, very slowly and very carefully, like he was riding a skateboard."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "回到学校后，他告诉了他的中国朋友这件事。",
      "traditional": "回到學校後，他告訴了他的中國朋友這件事。",
      "pinyin": "huí dào xué xiào hòu tā gào su le tā de zhōng guó péng you zhè jiàn shì",
      "english": "But Paul then realized that a few people were staring at him oddly."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "他的朋友听完哈哈大笑，说：“哎呀，那是告诉你要小心地面很滑，",
      "traditional": "他的朋友聽完哈哈大笑，說：“哎呀，那是告訴你要小心地面很滑，",
      "pinyin": "tā de péng you tīng wán hā hā dà xiào shuō āi yā nà shì gào su nǐ yào xiǎo xīn dì miàn hěn huá",
      "english": "After he returned to the school, he told his Chinese friend what had happened."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "不是让你滑着进卫生间啊！”",
      "traditional": "不是讓你滑著進衛生間啊！”",
      "pinyin": "bú shì ràng nǐ huá zhe jìn wèi shēng jiān a",
      "english": "After hearing this, his friend burst into laughter: “Ahh, the board instructs people to mind the slippery floor.”"
    }
  ],
